# GX Unleashed 5.0.4, by AKC12: a rebalance of F-Zero GX's machines and custom parts, and three of the game's rule
# numbers its main module changes (code by Twilight).
# Included with permission (AKC12 for the car data, Twilight for the code). Credit: AKC12, Twilight.
#
# This file holds the mod's changed values only: the 1,320 words of its car data file that differ from the disc's
# (F-Zero GX, USA), in all 41 machines and all 75 custom parts; and the allowed constants its enemy_line/line__.bin
# changes (handbook/stat-pack-constants.md): a boost frame's energy use, the speed cap, and the dash plate's boost
# (its code's int(30 + 15 x boost duration), carried as DashPlateBase and DashPlateScale). The mod's files are not in
# this repository, and nothing of the game's own data is in this file.
#
# Made by the launcher's import from a copy of the mod's files (cardata.lz SHA-1
# 217db933870844d1373d54ef2baf7d48fb6d4282, "jank camera removed"; the Standard variant's line__.bin SHA-1 635acf52...)
# against the unchanged disc image:
#   Launcher.App --import-stat-pack cardata.lz --main-module line__.bin --disc "F-Zero GX (USA).iso" --pack-name "GX Unleashed" --pack-author AKC12 --out gx-unleashed.fzstats
# Its fingerprint: 573d7fde9be73e4027139716338f39bbb3f3f5cf (without its constant lines it is the pack of 0.2.x,
# c24e75a89b536ee679c312f1474082da6418b55c). Not to be changed by hand: another value is another pack, which every
# game of a race must hold alike (handbook/stat-packs.md).
fzstats 1
